---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about CodesCompiler, our educational mission, tutorials, coding resources, and commitment to useful technical content."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white shadow-sm my-8 rounded-lg">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6">About CodesCompiler</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-brand prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p>
        <strong>CodesCompiler</strong> is an independent educational website focused on
        practical programming and web-development learning. We create free tutorials,
        examples, references, definitions, interview questions, coding programs, articles,
        and interactive learning resources.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        Our mission is to make technical education easier to understand and accessible to
        learners at different skill levels. We aim to explain concepts step by step and
        provide practical examples that readers can test and adapt.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Publish</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python, SQL, PHP, and SEO tutorials.</li>
        <li>Programming examples and practice programs.</li>
        <li>Technical definitions and computer-science terminology.</li>
        <li>Programming interview questions and preparation resources.</li>
        <li>Web-development articles, tools, references, and learning guides.</li>
        <li>Educational resources and beginner-friendly books.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Support the Website</h2>
      <p>
        Much of CodesCompiler is available free of charge. We may use advertising, including
        Google AdSense, to help support hosting, development, maintenance, and the continued
        creation of educational content.
      </p>

      <h2>Content Quality</h2>
      <p>
        We work to keep our tutorials useful, clear, and relevant. Because programming
        languages, browsers, frameworks, libraries, and online services change frequently,
        some content may need updates over time. Please see our
        <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a> for more information.
      </p>

      <h2>Transparency</h2>
      <p>
        We provide public information about our privacy practices, cookies, terms, and
        advertising. You can review our
        <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>,
        <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>,
        <a href="/terms-of-service/">Terms of Service</a>, and
        <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        For questions, corrections, feedback, advertising-related inquiries, or other
        website matters, please email
        <a href="mailto:contact@codescompiler.com">contact@codescompiler.com</a>
        or visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact Us</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
